docs/vanilla-examples/barchart-examples","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/vanilla-examples/barchart-examples#breakdown","content":"Page loads"},"378":{"id":"/docs/vanilla-examples/barchart-examples-34","page_id":"/docs/vanilla-examples/barchart-examples","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/vanilla-examples/barchart-examples#breakdown","content":"Chart created, added to page"},"379":{"id":"/docs/vanilla-examples/barchart-examples-35","page_id":"/docs/vanilla-examples/barchart-examples","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/vanilla-examples/barchart-examples#breakdown","content":"At this point it looks normal with all bars full-width"},"380":{"id":"/docs/vanilla-examples/barchart-examples-36","page_id":"/docs/vanilla-examples/barchart-examples","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/vanilla-examples/barchart-examples#breakdown","content":"`100ms` after, `scaleX` set to `0` so now the bars are suddenly gone, causing a flicker"},"381":{"id":"/docs/vanilla-examples/barchart-examples-37","page_id":"/docs/vanilla-examples/barchart-examples","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/vanilla-examples/barchart-examples#breakdown","content":"The fix here is simple, and coming soon. I will add a `barStyle` option which will allow you to set inline styles for each bar, which'll get tacked onto them - avoiding the flicker."},"382":{"id":"/docs/vanilla-examples/barchart-examples-38","page_id":"/docs/vanilla-examples/barchart-examples","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/vanilla-examples/barchart-examples#breakdown","content":"All that being said, the `transform-origin` is only relevant when you're moving the bars in some way, something like `opacity` or `fill` wouldn't require that at all."},"383":{"id":"/docs/vanilla-examples/barchart-examples-39","page_id":"/docs/vanilla-examples/barchart-examples","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/vanilla-examples/barchart-examples#transformorigin-guide","content":"Regardless, here's a table & visual guide for all placement options!"},"384":{"